cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "disorder_mc"
abstract: >-
  Tools for exploring ordered configurations of disordered crystal structures,
  built on pymatgen: symmetry analysis, configuration degeneracy,
  disordered-structure Ewald energetics, energy-ranked random sampling,
  exhaustive enumeration, and a configurable Monte Carlo ordering engine.
authors:
  - given-names: Charlie
    family-names: Schwarz
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/CharlesSchwarz/disorderly"
url: "https://github.com/CharlesSchwarz/disorderly"
keywords:
  - materials science
  - crystallography
  - disorder
  - Monte Carlo
  - Ewald
  - pymatgen
